        <ezobject:attribute xmlns:ezremote="http://ez.no/ezobject" ezremote:id="1408" ezremote:identifier="description" name="Description" type="ezxmltext">
          <section xmlns:image="http://ez.no/namespaces/ezpublish3/image/" xmlns:custom="http://ez.no/namespaces/ezpublish3/custom/" xmlns:xhtml="http://ez.no/namespaces/ezpublish3/xhtml/">
            <paragraph>Workout motivation can be… a little hard to come by sometimes. Finding that little piece of inspiration that gives you fitness motivation, and then STAYING motivated to work out and keep up with a healthy lifestyle… that’s even harder to come by.</paragraph>
            <paragraph>The concept of “motivation” is pretty elusive, especially when you’re talking about something so random as workout motivation, or fitness motivation, or even just healthy lifestyle motivation. In this video I share 5 tips for getting motivated to workout, and a few tricks that make it easier to STAY motivated (which is the hardest part!)</paragraph>
          </section>
